1
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,480
He flaked on us.

2
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:46,080
Why do you look kind of happy?

3
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,760
Do I?

4
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:52,200
I just think

5
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,080
the weather is great today.

6
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,600
Are we setting out yet?

7
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:07,920
Are you sitting there?

8
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:09,919
What's wrong?

9
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:13,760
My driving is just so-so.

10
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:16,400
If I miss an exit or go the wrong way,

11
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:17,320
we'll waste time.

12
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:21,280
Bi Dezheng isn't coming.

13
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:24,040
There's no one next to me to warn me.

14
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:26,320
Then I'll sit up front.

15
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,400
I brought them for you.

16
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,320
Thank you.

17
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:48,760
Let's go.

18
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:04,360
FAST REPAIRS OF PHONES AND DIGITAL DEVICES

19
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:07,160
It's the weekend.
What's with the backpack?

20
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:09,320
I'm going to study.

21
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:13,120
Well, you can study anywhere.
Why do you need to go out?

22
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,040
It's with a classmate.

23
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:17,640
Which classmate?

24
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:18,960
Give me your phone.

25
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,080
Call him.

26
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:25,280
It has only been a few days of calm.

27
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:27,160
I thought you had finally given up.

28
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,960
What could happen at a hospital?

29
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:31,200
Did they have to call
a high school student?

30
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:33,520
- I'm not going to the hospital.
- Denying it?

31
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:35,880
Listen, you're not going anywhere today.

32
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:47,720
<i>Something came up today.</i>
<i>I can't tutor you. Can we reschedule?</i>

33
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,680
JIANG MIAN

34
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:52,080
<i>This is way too last-minute.</i>

35
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:54,280
<i>We can't reschedule. I already came out.</i>

36
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:56,360
<i>You promised to fill in for Ms. Zheng.</i>

37
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:58,560
<i>I'm telling your sister!</i>

38
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:04,520
<i>What's this?</i>
<i>Are you really standing me up?</i>

39
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:09,200
<i>Sorry, the subscriber you dialed</i>
<i>is not available.</i>

40
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,600
Hello, Jiahuan.

41
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:19,360
Do you know people in Year 2, Class 8?

42
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:23,080
Help me ask around
and find out where Jian Mian lives.

43
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:25,520
JIANG HAIXING DIGITAL REPAIR

44
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:31,520
Can people live here?

45
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,640
FAST REPAIRS

46
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:37,760
What do you want to buy?

47
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:39,920
Hello, sir. Are you Jiang Mian's dad?

48
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:42,640
I am.

49
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:45,840
I am Jiang Mian's…

50
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,880
classmate.

51
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:50,000
He and I have tutoring with a teacher.

52
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,520
He couldn't be reached on the phone,

53
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:55,480
so the teacher asked me to come and see

54
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:58,360
if something came up
that he needs help with.

55
00:04:58,440 --> 00:05:00,040
Teacher?

56
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:03,320
He didn't tell me. What tutoring?

57
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:06,360
It's a private lesson for us.

58
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:08,520
We're not supposed to tell anyone.

59
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:11,480
She's afraid other students
would have complaints.

60
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:14,200
After all, it's free private tutoring.

61
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:15,320
Sir, you understand.

62
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,200
I guess

63
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:22,080
Jiang Mian

64
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,680
isn't free today.

65
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,000
It's okay.

66
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:26,880
I'll just go back and tell Ms. Sun

67
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:29,200
so she doesn't blame Jiang Mian.

68
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:32,560
Wait, you…

69
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,680
Can he still make it if he goes now?

70
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,240
Yes. Where is he?

71
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:39,920
I… Hold on.

72
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,240
Jiang Mian!

73
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:42,960
Jiang Mian, I was wrong!

74
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,640
I wrongly blamed you!

75
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:47,240
Listen, it's all thanks
to my cleverness and wit.

76
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:50,920
You lied. There is no private lesson
from a teacher.

77
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:53,520
If lying is wrong, why did you play along?

78
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,680
Would we be here
if you hadn't played along?

79
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,760
But your dad…

80
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,920
That guy keeps you on such a tight leash.

81
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,280
He looks so mean.

82
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:05,320
He looks completely different
from when he gave you those gloves.

83
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:08,320
That's why I threw away those gloves.

84
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:09,560
You did?

85
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:12,840
So you didn't accidentally toss them.

86
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,840
It was on purpose.

87
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:18,400
He's just my uncle.

88
00:06:19,440 --> 00:06:21,480
No, not even that.

89
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,280
He divorced long ago.

90
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,480
He has no wife or kids.

91
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:28,720
He adopted me to have someone
take care of him later.

92
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:30,800
He's so controlling

93
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:33,240
because he's afraid
I'll leave with my sister.

94
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:40,280
Was it a hassle to come here?

95
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:44,480
Why would it be? It was so much fun.

96
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:48,320
My mom told me a story when I was young.

97
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:51,200
In fairy tales,

98
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:53,320
a clever and valiant princess

99
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:55,800
must complete a series of impossible tasks

100
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:58,280
to rescue a prince imprisoned by a dragon.

101
00:06:58,360 --> 00:07:01,200
No matter how difficult it is,

102
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:04,000
she will join hands
with the prince to attain victory.

103
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:10,160
Turns out there really is
an imprisoned prince.

104
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:15,400
The next time you're trapped,
call this princess to rescue you.

105
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:21,640
To celebrate our successful rescue today!

106
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:35,280
You've been carrying this.

107
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,760
What is it?

108
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:42,640
I got up early to line up for it.

109
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,400
It's the best sushi in Qingyi.

110
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:47,720
Who knew I would nearly get stood up?

111
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,000
Don't you want tutoring?

112
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,120
Yes.

113
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:55,080
Eating the best sushi doesn't
get in the way of getting the best lesson.

114
00:07:58,200 --> 00:08:00,520
It also serves as a bribe

115
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,320
for my new teacher.

116
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:05,240
Have mercy during my lesson.

117
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,400
What a shame.

118
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,120
It originally came with wasabi.

119
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:14,400
Now the taste will be just shy of perfect.

120
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,960
Where did the wasabi go?

121
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,960
Just eat it.

122
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:21,760
Don't ask so many questions.

123
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:28,520
REPAIRS AND RECYCLING

124
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,679
Jiang Mian!

125
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:35,320
I don't let you go out,

126
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:37,039
and you refuse to talk to me?

127
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:39,880
Who is the one who feeds you?

128
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,480
Since you entered high school,

129
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:45,640
that money sink hasn't spent any
money on you, you know that?!

130
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,840
If not for me, would you get an education?

131
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:49,880
You would be stuck in your hometown!

132
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:53,440
Why is this person so mean?

133
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,440
WASABI ON TOP

134
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:21,200
What do you want to buy?

135
00:09:21,280 --> 00:09:24,160
Hello, sir. Are you Jiang Mian's dad?

136
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:29,080
Jiang Mian is quite popular
with the girls.

137
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,320
He takes after me.

138
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:16,680
It's best to take samples
at fixed times. Let's do it in two hours.

139
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,760
Did we come too early?

140
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,840
Why Qingshan Island?

141
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:24,240
I heard long ago that it's very beautiful,

142
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,480
so I wanted to see it.

143
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:28,120
We're not early.

144
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,600
We get time to look around.

145
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:36,560
This path leads to Qingshan Tower.
We can see the whole island from the top.

146
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,680
You've done your research.

147
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:43,120
Just in case someone asked,

148
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:45,120
I didn't want to be clueless.

149
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,280
Let's go.

150
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:49,360
We just follow this path.

151
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,440
Not bad, right?

152
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:01,120
The view is nice.

153
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:05,160
We can also
see both lighthouses from here.

154
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,560
By the way,

155
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:08,680
there's a legend about the lighthouses.

156
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:12,000
When two people climb up here together,

157
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:16,880
the direction of travel of the first ship
they see between the lighthouses

158
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:20,080
is where the two will travel to together
in the future.

159
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:26,120
Why does that sound like a story
made up by the Tourism Bureau?

160
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:30,600
Believe what you want.

161
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,280
West.

162
00:11:41,880 --> 00:11:44,440
There are a lot of cities to the west.

163
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:48,800
I thought someone didn't believe in this.

164
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:53,800
Chen Yanzhou,

165
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:58,600
will you go to another city
or country in the future?

166
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:02,200
Why do you suddenly ask?

167
00:12:03,680 --> 00:12:05,720
I heard Mr. Li mention that

168
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:08,640
the Haeckel Institute research opportunity
is a good fit for you.

169
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:12,640
It's what you're truly interested in

170
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:14,520
and your preferred research focus.

171
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,560
I don't want to go.

172
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:21,720
Why?

173
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,160
Because

174
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:28,360
the people close to me

175
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,920
matter far more than anything else.

176
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:38,560
I think you're right.

177
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:41,840
The Tourism Bureau must have
made up that legend.

178
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:44,320
I'm not going anywhere.

179
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,320
I'll be here.

180
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:07,160
RESEARCH FARM

181
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:08,760
Bi Dezheng?

182
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:12,600
<i>Surprise! I'm here!</i>

183
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:18,960
Originally,

184
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:20,280
I couldn't come.

185
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,280
But as you said,

186
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:23,880
it's a pity if we can't come as a team.

187
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:27,720
How could I leave you with regrets?
We're a team!

188
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:30,280
Luckily, I made up my mind.

189
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:33,280
There is still a while
until the fixed sampling time.

190
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,200
We can play.

191
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:37,720
Sir, we want to rent some bikes.

192
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:39,240
There are only two left.

193
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:50,720
- Zheng Yu, why don't you--
- Oh well.

194
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:53,040
Zheng Yu, sit behind me. I'll bike.

195
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:59,880
You don't need to look at him.
I can carry you. Come on.

196
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,000
Bi Dezheng.

197
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,800
You look so sharp today.

198
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:09,840
You will definitely charm all the ladies
as you bike around.

199
00:14:12,880 --> 00:14:14,520
W… What?

200
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:16,520
Why are you suddenly complimenting me?

201
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:18,400
Really?

202
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:22,120
But if someone is riding behind you,

203
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:24,160
others might get the wrong idea.

204
00:14:26,280 --> 00:14:27,280
True.

205
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,960
You'll be ruining my chances.

206
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:37,200
Yanzhou, why don't you take one
for the team and carry Zheng Yu?

207
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:39,200
No offense.

208
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:46,160
She's so skinny. She's light!

209
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:52,320
I'll owe you one.

210
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,240
All right.

211
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,920
Do I really look cool?

212
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:07,240
Go on.

213
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:25,280
Where did you trick Bi Dezheng into going?

214
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:27,080
I have no idea where he went.

215
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:30,160
All I know is we're going downhill.

216
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,520
Sit tight.

217
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:09,960
Take it. Come on.

218
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:36,280
Get closer.

219
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,360
Closer.

220
00:17:13,119 --> 00:17:14,520
It pisses me off!

221
00:17:14,599 --> 00:17:16,280
Twelve yuan for a bottle of water!

222
00:17:16,359 --> 00:17:18,000
I flirted for ten minutes

223
00:17:18,079 --> 00:17:19,520
and didn't get any discount!

224
00:17:20,119 --> 00:17:21,119
Flirted?

225
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:24,920
By calling them "Brother"?

226
00:17:27,359 --> 00:17:28,840
Do I call anyone "Brother"?

227
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,520
Then how do you flirt?

228
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:37,040
Sister,

229
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:38,840
take six yuan off.

230
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,440
Twelve yuan per water bottle

231
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:44,080
is just too outrageous.

232
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:48,080
Brother, I like you the most.

233
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:52,720
Zheng Yu,

234
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:54,840
I rarely see you smiling so happily.

235
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:55,760
What a surprise.

236
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:59,120
There's a lot you don't know about me.

237
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:03,160
Then do you know how to flirt?

238
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:05,960
Why not?

239
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:11,200
Come on, try it on me.

240
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:12,960
Let's see how good you are.

241
00:18:14,120 --> 00:18:16,080
I'll give you a simple challenge.

242
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:17,480
Just say,

243
00:18:18,280 --> 00:18:19,320
"Is it okay?"

244
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:25,520
Bi Dezheng, is it okay?

245
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:29,120
That's it?

246
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:31,200
You call that flirting?

247
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:34,120
- Isn't it?
- How can it count?

248
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:36,640
Maybe the target isn't right.

249
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:39,920
W… What do you mean by that?

250
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:42,280
You can do it with others but not me?

251
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:43,200
Of course.

252
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:46,280
Stubborn, are you? You're in for it.

253
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:49,320
Come on. Say it to Chen Yanzhou.

254
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:58,880
It's okay.

255
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:01,160
Whatever you do, I won't make fun of you.

256
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:07,080
Chen Yanzhou, is it okay?

257
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:14,400
Okay.

258
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:16,120
Okay, what?

259
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:17,760
What's okay?

260
00:19:18,360 --> 00:19:19,920
Isn't it exactly the same?

261
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:21,760
Chen Yanzhou, how is that flirting?

262
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:25,040
Why not? You don't know
how to appreciate it.

263
00:19:26,320 --> 00:19:27,320
I…

264
00:19:31,760 --> 00:19:35,040
Chen Yanzhou, you're smiling
as if you're her boyfriend.

265
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:36,920
Mind how that looks.

266
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:41,800
It's about time.

267
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:43,120
We should go get samples.

268
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:45,600
I'll get the tools.

269
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,200
All done.

270
00:20:02,280 --> 00:20:04,320
I'll go wash my hands.
Let's meet over there.

271
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:18,320
What are you looking at?
You're smiling so sweetly.

272
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,480
Chatting with your girlfriend?

273
00:20:31,280 --> 00:20:32,520
Get up.

274
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:37,800
Something's up.

275
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:40,960
Today, you made me bike alone,

276
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:42,560
and you've been hiding smiles.

277
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:44,760
What's up with that?

278
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:47,800
Isn't it obvious?

279
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:52,080
Wait, seriously?

280
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:57,920
Chen Yanzhou,

281
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,160
you jerk.

282
00:21:01,040 --> 00:21:02,280
You're already dating.

283
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:04,600
Why are you fooling around with Zheng Yu?

284
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:06,720
What if your girlfriend finds out?

285
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:08,800
You…

286
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:11,080
At most, people will call you a player.

287
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:13,600
But how will she survive on campus?

288
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:16,240
- Bi Dezheng.
- What?

289
00:21:16,320 --> 00:21:17,800
No wonder you can't graduate.

290
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:20,360
Hey, why are you attacking me?

291
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:23,240
I have to hurry back.

292
00:21:23,320 --> 00:21:25,120
Don't make Zheng Yu wait.

293
00:21:26,120 --> 00:21:29,320
Chen Yanzhou, you had
better watch out. I'm watching you.

294
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:45,880
Zheng Yu.

295
00:21:46,760 --> 00:21:48,440
Zheng Yu, I have to talk to you.

296
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:56,040
Where did you find
so many student ID cards?

297
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:58,560
I didn't find them.

298
00:21:58,640 --> 00:21:59,880
I borrowed them.

299
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:02,920
You know, our student ID photos
are unedited.

300
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:04,680
It's as legit as a real ID card.

301
00:22:06,840 --> 00:22:08,880
Okay, then. See the card, see the man.

302
00:22:08,960 --> 00:22:09,960
I'll introduce them.

303
00:22:10,040 --> 00:22:13,640
They're all young, eligible bachelors.

304
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:15,600
Li Geng, physical education.

305
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:17,520
A total hunk.

306
00:22:17,600 --> 00:22:19,240
A long-distance running champ.

307
00:22:19,320 --> 00:22:21,320
One punch could take down two of me.

308
00:22:21,400 --> 00:22:22,360
But don't worry.

309
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:24,920
He's very well-mannered and not violent.

310
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:27,680
Not to your liking?

311
00:22:28,320 --> 00:22:29,400
Next.

312
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:32,400
Wei Haijie, fine arts.

313
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:35,480
He may have long hair
and an air of indifference,

314
00:22:35,560 --> 00:22:37,440
but his paintings sell for thousands.

315
00:22:37,520 --> 00:22:39,160
And he loves to help others.

316
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:41,000
Not interested either?

317
00:22:41,840 --> 00:22:42,800
Wait.

318
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:45,360
Why are you showing me these?

319
00:22:47,760 --> 00:22:49,000
I just want to show you

320
00:22:49,080 --> 00:22:51,760
that there are plenty of outstanding men
in the world.

321
00:22:51,840 --> 00:22:54,960
You don't have to
put all your eggs in one basket.

322
00:22:55,040 --> 00:22:56,960
What's your type? Tell me.

323
00:22:57,040 --> 00:22:58,720
I will introduce guys to you.

324
00:22:59,480 --> 00:23:02,480
Here. Deng Zhenfei, same year as me.

325
00:23:02,560 --> 00:23:04,040
He may have a fair complexion,

326
00:23:04,120 --> 00:23:06,680
but he's the president
of our school's Hiking Club.

327
00:23:06,760 --> 00:23:08,240
He's in peak condition.

328
00:23:08,320 --> 00:23:09,480
Chen Yanzhou.

329
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:16,480
Eating together again?

330
00:23:17,360 --> 00:23:18,640
Clearly.

331
00:23:20,760 --> 00:23:21,640
What's up?

332
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:23,640
He…

333
00:23:36,240 --> 00:23:38,480
None of them can fight.

334
00:23:40,800 --> 00:23:42,040
Shengyang.

335
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:47,520
You've been standing here.

336
00:23:47,600 --> 00:23:49,440
Why haven't you changed and gone in?

337
00:23:51,760 --> 00:23:54,400
I just came from the boss's office.

338
00:23:54,480 --> 00:23:57,280
He gave me a box of chocolates.
I wanted to share them.

339
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:01,640
Yeah right.

340
00:24:02,720 --> 00:24:03,880
I just saw you.

341
00:24:03,960 --> 00:24:06,160
You were about to stuff it
into that locker.

342
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:10,440
Relax. I won't tell anyone.

343
00:24:10,520 --> 00:24:13,400
But this is way too indirect.

344
00:24:14,280 --> 00:24:17,600
We're not little kids.
Who would get it from some chocolates?

345
00:24:18,560 --> 00:24:22,840
Well, everyone in the lab is busy
and has no time for dating.

346
00:24:22,920 --> 00:24:24,360
It's better to take it slow.

347
00:24:26,600 --> 00:24:29,760
Okay, take it slow.

348
00:24:37,680 --> 00:24:39,840
<i>The one he likes is Zheng Yu?</i>

349
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:42,800
<i>Right! I nearly forgot!</i>

350
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:45,720
<i>He's the one</i>
<i>who recommended her to the boss.</i>

351
00:24:46,560 --> 00:24:48,080
Shengyang!

352
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:51,840
Taking it slow actually isn't a good idea.
What if you miss your chance?

353
00:24:53,240 --> 00:24:54,320
What do you mean?

354
00:24:54,920 --> 00:24:55,840
Confess.

355
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:57,040
You must confess.

356
00:25:12,280 --> 00:25:13,400
Zheng Yu.

357
00:25:16,720 --> 00:25:18,200
Shengyang.

358
00:25:18,280 --> 00:25:19,440
You didn't pick up.

359
00:25:19,520 --> 00:25:21,720
I guessed you were in class here.

360
00:25:22,800 --> 00:25:25,640
Did you come find me about something?

361
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:39,520
Zheng Yu,

362
00:25:39,600 --> 00:25:41,920
we've known each other
for three years, right?

363
00:25:43,160 --> 00:25:44,360
More or less.

364
00:25:45,880 --> 00:25:48,560
I remember I was an undergraduate senior,

365
00:25:48,640 --> 00:25:50,280
and you were a freshman.

366
00:25:50,360 --> 00:25:51,960
You were always on the go,

367
00:25:52,040 --> 00:25:53,800
picking up part-time gigs.

368
00:25:53,880 --> 00:25:57,160
I was reminded of
when I first got into university.

369
00:25:57,240 --> 00:25:58,240
We're quite similar.

370
00:26:01,440 --> 00:26:03,640
My family is just getting by.

371
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:06,760
I grew up with hardships.

372
00:26:06,840 --> 00:26:09,400
So I worked hard to get into this place

373
00:26:09,480 --> 00:26:11,280
to escape my old life.

374
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:13,480
I get it.

375
00:26:17,040 --> 00:26:20,560
So before I achieved this goal,

376
00:26:21,520 --> 00:26:24,720
I didn't want to confess my feelings
to the one I like.

377
00:26:26,760 --> 00:26:28,160
The only thing I could do

378
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:31,160
was keep finding part-time gigs

379
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:32,080
for her.

380
00:26:36,520 --> 00:26:37,800
Zheng Yu,

381
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:40,000
I like you.

382
00:26:43,040 --> 00:26:45,040
- Shengyang, I--
- Let me finish.

383
00:26:46,080 --> 00:26:49,320
I planned to wait until I graduated
with a master's degree.

384
00:26:50,000 --> 00:26:52,240
You'll be graduating
with a bachelor's too.

385
00:26:52,320 --> 00:26:55,200
If you want to stay in Qingyi,
I will stay with you.

386
00:26:56,200 --> 00:26:59,320
If you want to pursue
a master's degree, I'll find a job.

387
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:03,240
The best outcome is both of us staying.

388
00:27:03,320 --> 00:27:06,480
After all, the pay is good,
and it's stable.

389
00:27:06,560 --> 00:27:08,880
Of course, this depends on your opinion.

390
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:10,560
Shengyang,

391
00:27:10,640 --> 00:27:12,760
thank you for liking me.

392
00:27:12,840 --> 00:27:14,560
But

393
00:27:14,640 --> 00:27:16,200
there's someone I like already.

394
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:25,760
Is it Chen Yanzhou?

395
00:27:28,640 --> 00:27:29,680
How did you know?

396
00:27:33,680 --> 00:27:37,080
At the boss's birthday party,
I sensed something between you two.

397
00:27:40,200 --> 00:27:43,560
A while ago, you asked me to find out
about the Haeckel Institute.

398
00:27:43,640 --> 00:27:46,520
You said it was for
a very important friend.

399
00:27:47,120 --> 00:27:48,800
Is Chen Yanzhou that friend?

400
00:27:56,760 --> 00:28:00,320
Shengyang, I have to leave
for my tutoring job.

401
00:28:03,280 --> 00:28:05,120
You can't go abroad with him.

402
00:28:05,720 --> 00:28:07,280
Would he stay for you?

403
00:28:08,080 --> 00:28:10,720
Or do you plan to have him pay

404
00:28:10,800 --> 00:28:12,080
for you to go with him?

405
00:28:17,080 --> 00:28:18,560
You've got it all wrong.

406
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:20,680
I don't need him to stay.

407
00:28:20,760 --> 00:28:22,800
Nor do I need him to take me with him.

408
00:28:23,560 --> 00:28:26,760
I know what it feels like
to carry too many burdens.

409
00:28:30,120 --> 00:28:31,840
So I hope that,

410
00:28:32,840 --> 00:28:34,520
at least from now on,

411
00:28:35,320 --> 00:28:36,720
he can be free.

412
00:29:01,520 --> 00:29:03,000
Chatting with Zheng Yu again?

413
00:29:04,040 --> 00:29:06,400
Yes. Who else would I be chatting with?

414
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:10,440
My girlfriend?

415
00:29:13,320 --> 00:29:14,640
Chen Yanzhou,

416
00:29:15,320 --> 00:29:17,480
you're so shameless.

417
00:29:18,760 --> 00:29:21,160
You're even proud of cheating?

418
00:29:23,040 --> 00:29:24,600
You're even laughing?

419
00:29:28,760 --> 00:29:30,440
With your vivid imagination,

420
00:29:30,520 --> 00:29:31,960
didn't you ever consider

421
00:29:32,040 --> 00:29:35,040
that the two people in your story
are the same person?

422
00:29:35,120 --> 00:29:36,760
What do you mean, two people…

423
00:29:37,840 --> 00:29:39,520
are… are the same person?

424
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:41,360
W… What do you mean?

425
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:42,920
Are you saying…?

426
00:29:44,120 --> 00:29:45,800
There has only ever been

427
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:47,480
one person I like.

428
00:29:53,960 --> 00:29:55,360
Bro.

429
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:56,920
Dear bro.

430
00:29:57,000 --> 00:29:58,560
I've done you wrong.

431
00:29:59,160 --> 00:30:00,560
I think I did

432
00:30:01,160 --> 00:30:02,400
something terrible.

433
00:30:07,080 --> 00:30:09,880
<i>I didn't mean to push Shengyang</i>
<i>to confess his feelings.</i>

434
00:30:09,960 --> 00:30:11,720
<i>I was out of ideas.</i>

435
00:30:11,800 --> 00:30:14,440
<i>If it could break you two up,</i>
<i>I had to try it.</i>

436
00:30:14,520 --> 00:30:17,440
<i>I thought maybe Zheng Yu would be</i>
<i>distracted after the confession.</i>

437
00:30:17,520 --> 00:30:21,000
<i>It sounded better than letting her</i>
<i>end up as a side piece.</i>

438
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:26,000
I forgot. She's probably
tutoring right now.

439
00:30:38,520 --> 00:30:39,840
Chen Yanzhou?

440
00:30:44,040 --> 00:30:45,200
Are you done tutoring?

441
00:30:46,800 --> 00:30:48,160
Why didn't you go in?

442
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:51,240
I…

443
00:30:51,840 --> 00:30:54,520
Were you waiting for me?

444
00:30:56,240 --> 00:30:57,320
I…

445
00:30:58,200 --> 00:31:00,080
I just happened

446
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:01,720
to be walking nearby.

447
00:31:05,080 --> 00:31:06,800
- Here?
- Yes.

448
00:31:06,880 --> 00:31:07,720
Walking.

449
00:31:17,920 --> 00:31:18,920
So,

450
00:31:19,920 --> 00:31:20,960
today,

451
00:31:21,640 --> 00:31:23,240
did Shengyang confess to you?

452
00:31:28,400 --> 00:31:30,120
So

453
00:31:31,440 --> 00:31:32,680
what was your reply?

454
00:31:34,920 --> 00:31:36,040
I didn't accept.

455
00:31:40,480 --> 00:31:43,520
Were you waiting here for me

456
00:31:43,600 --> 00:31:44,560
to ask about this?

457
00:31:46,120 --> 00:31:47,560
I really was walking nearby.

458
00:31:51,240 --> 00:31:53,120
It's dark. I'll walk you back.

459
00:31:53,200 --> 00:31:54,040
It's on the way.

460
00:31:55,000 --> 00:31:56,960
A few kilometers' detour is on the way?

461
00:31:59,200 --> 00:32:01,600
All right. On the way.

462
00:32:02,320 --> 00:32:03,480
Let's go.

463
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:28,920
By the way,

464
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:31,600
stay away from Bi Dezheng.

465
00:32:33,080 --> 00:32:34,480
What did he do now?

466
00:32:35,680 --> 00:32:37,880
He actually suspected us of…

467
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:42,400
Forget it. It's my fault.

468
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:45,040
I'm usually too reserved.

469
00:32:45,120 --> 00:32:46,200
Some relationships

470
00:32:47,480 --> 00:32:49,120
should've been made official.

471
00:32:49,720 --> 00:32:51,320
W… What was that?

472
00:32:53,760 --> 00:32:55,560
- I mean…
- I thought it was delicious.

473
00:32:55,640 --> 00:32:56,760
Me too.

474
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:03,600
What's wrong?

475
00:33:03,680 --> 00:33:04,880
My roommates are back.

476
00:33:06,720 --> 00:33:08,480
It's Zheng Yu.

477
00:33:09,800 --> 00:33:11,120
LIYUAN BUILDING 9

478
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:12,880
Zheng Yu,

479
00:33:12,960 --> 00:33:15,200
why are you lingering out here?

480
00:33:16,800 --> 00:33:19,680
We… We're discussing experiments.

481
00:33:20,920 --> 00:33:22,640
Did you just come from the lab?

482
00:33:22,720 --> 00:33:23,960
- Yes.
- No.

483
00:33:27,960 --> 00:33:28,800
- Yes.
- No.

484
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:36,720
I'm not the dean,

485
00:33:36,800 --> 00:33:38,360
catching students dating.

486
00:33:39,800 --> 00:33:41,000
Why are you acting guilty?

487
00:33:41,840 --> 00:33:42,680
True.

488
00:33:44,160 --> 00:33:45,360
No reason to act guilty.

489
00:33:49,840 --> 00:33:51,680
No, it's not what you think.

490
00:33:52,280 --> 00:33:53,400
We…

491
00:33:54,600 --> 00:33:56,320
You should go home first.

492
00:33:57,200 --> 00:33:58,520
Then I'll go.

493
00:34:00,440 --> 00:34:01,840
Good night.

494
00:34:14,440 --> 00:34:16,960
Why are you looking at me?

495
00:34:18,120 --> 00:34:21,600
I've never seen an iron tree bloom,
so I'm looking my fill.

496
00:34:23,080 --> 00:34:25,400
I'm getting goosebumps.

497
00:34:27,360 --> 00:34:28,520
You've misunderstood.

498
00:34:28,600 --> 00:34:30,800
Yes, we misunderstood.

499
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:33,120
You were discussing experiments.

500
00:34:35,159 --> 00:34:40,520
Love is such a grand experiment.

501
00:34:42,880 --> 00:34:43,840
No.

502
00:34:43,920 --> 00:34:44,960
Yes.

503
00:34:45,040 --> 00:34:45,920
No.

504
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:47,159
Yes.

505
00:34:47,239 --> 00:34:48,560
Good night.

506
00:34:48,639 --> 00:34:49,800
Right?

507
00:34:49,880 --> 00:34:51,639
Good night.

508
00:35:09,360 --> 00:35:10,520
What's wrong?

509
00:35:10,600 --> 00:35:11,680
My roommates are back.

510
00:35:35,720 --> 00:35:38,120
ZHENG YU

511
00:35:48,760 --> 00:35:50,600
If I fail my finals,

512
00:35:50,680 --> 00:35:52,440
Zheng Yu, you're responsible.

513
00:35:56,360 --> 00:35:57,560
Why am I responsible?

514
00:35:59,120 --> 00:36:00,960
Finals week just started.

515
00:36:01,720 --> 00:36:03,640
It's the time for rote memorization,

516
00:36:04,640 --> 00:36:07,720
but my mind is blank,
with only two words echoing around.

517
00:36:10,600 --> 00:36:11,480
"Good night."

518
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:17,240
Don't use the two of us as an excuse.

519
00:36:20,600 --> 00:36:23,120
- "Us."
- "Us."

520
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:30,480
CHEN YANZHOU

521
00:36:30,560 --> 00:36:32,440
<i>When is your last final?</i>

522
00:36:35,880 --> 00:36:37,480
<i>Friday morning.</i>

523
00:36:38,400 --> 00:36:40,600
<i>Are you free after that?</i>

524
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:42,800
<i>Yes.</i>

525
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:45,560
Say, will the first one of us to couple up

526
00:36:45,640 --> 00:36:46,800
be Zheng Yu?

527
00:36:48,320 --> 00:36:49,480
Anyway, it won't be me.

528
00:36:49,560 --> 00:36:51,320
Or me.

529
00:36:56,080 --> 00:36:57,520
CHEN YANZHOU

530
00:36:57,600 --> 00:37:01,400
<i>Then let's go somewhere together</i>
<i>on Friday.</i>

531
00:37:01,480 --> 00:37:02,360
<i>Okay.</i>

532
00:37:02,440 --> 00:37:04,480
Going on a date right after exams?

533
00:37:07,560 --> 00:37:10,000
Xu Fangli, shouldn't you be studying?

534
00:37:10,080 --> 00:37:11,200
Study…

535
00:37:20,560 --> 00:37:25,240
Well, don't waste those clothes you bought
when we went shopping.

536
00:37:34,040 --> 00:37:35,760
So how did exams go?

537
00:37:36,440 --> 00:37:38,480
Not bad. You?

538
00:37:39,040 --> 00:37:39,880
I don't know.

539
00:37:40,480 --> 00:37:41,720
You don't know?

540
00:37:42,520 --> 00:37:44,720
I guess I don't care as much anymore.

541
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:48,480
Unbelievable.

542
00:37:49,240 --> 00:37:50,480
What?

543
00:37:50,560 --> 00:37:53,960
Someone is finally about to lose to me

544
00:37:54,040 --> 00:37:55,920
but tells me he doesn't care.

545
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:57,480
Must be some mind game.

546
00:37:58,160 --> 00:37:59,440
Are you that confident?

547
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:01,840
I'm definitely winning.

548
00:38:03,840 --> 00:38:05,360
What are you laughing for?

549
00:38:06,080 --> 00:38:07,280
I'm happy for you.

550
00:38:08,160 --> 00:38:09,840
I'm happy for you too.

551
00:38:09,920 --> 00:38:12,680
But where are we going?

552
00:38:12,760 --> 00:38:15,640
We've walked for so long.
It's almost dark.

553
00:38:15,720 --> 00:38:17,080
We're almost there.

554
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:21,480
- Quickly.
- Hurry up.

555
00:38:22,280 --> 00:38:24,080
- Walk faster.
- Hurry up.

556
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:28,200
We're here.

557
00:38:29,800 --> 00:38:31,320
I remember you said

558
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:33,480
you loved watching fish lantern parades.

559
00:38:33,560 --> 00:38:35,280
So I brought you here.

560
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:43,480
It was the right choice.

561
00:38:44,080 --> 00:38:46,800
That's the lantern.
It's the same as when I was a kid.

562
00:38:49,840 --> 00:38:52,800
Back then, my parents
would take my brother and me

563
00:38:52,880 --> 00:38:54,520
and run after that lantern.

564
00:38:54,600 --> 00:38:57,080
I didn't know anything.
I was just happy to run.

565
00:38:57,960 --> 00:38:59,160
Someone led the way.

566
00:38:59,240 --> 00:39:00,760
I just had to follow.

567
00:39:04,400 --> 00:39:05,320
You can still run.

568
00:40:24,560 --> 00:40:25,400
Zheng Yu.

569
00:40:29,240 --> 00:40:30,520
I like you.

570
00:40:43,280 --> 00:40:45,200
For a long time,

571
00:40:45,280 --> 00:40:46,720
my life was very simple.

572
00:40:47,560 --> 00:40:50,760
The lab, data figures, and my thesis.

573
00:40:51,840 --> 00:40:54,320
I thought that was my everything.

574
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:56,280
Then

575
00:40:56,360 --> 00:40:57,240
you appeared.

576
00:40:58,600 --> 00:40:59,960
I started to notice you.

577
00:41:00,680 --> 00:41:02,880
<i>I noticed the way you look when thinking.</i>

578
00:41:03,600 --> 00:41:04,480
<i>The way you frown.</i>

579
00:41:06,000 --> 00:41:09,800
<i>And when your eyes are red,</i>
<i>but you still push on.</i>

580
00:41:10,760 --> 00:41:13,200
<i>And your smile.</i>

581
00:41:33,080 --> 00:41:34,000
It's rare,

582
00:41:35,160 --> 00:41:36,640
but every time I see it,

583
00:41:36,720 --> 00:41:38,640
I think

584
00:41:38,720 --> 00:41:41,240
that my day isn't so bad after all.

585
00:41:45,440 --> 00:41:46,560
Zheng Yu,

586
00:41:47,560 --> 00:41:48,800
I like you.

587
00:41:49,520 --> 00:41:50,760
It's not maybe

588
00:41:50,840 --> 00:41:52,280
or possibly.

589
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:55,720
It's a definite, unremitting,

590
00:41:55,800 --> 00:41:57,360
impossible-to-ignore feeling.

591
00:42:02,320 --> 00:42:03,920
I don't need an answer from you.

592
00:42:04,520 --> 00:42:06,360
You don't need to reply either.

593
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:08,760
To me,

594
00:42:09,760 --> 00:42:11,640
compared to asking you to accept me,

595
00:42:12,560 --> 00:42:14,000
letting you know

596
00:42:14,800 --> 00:42:16,880
that someone likes you

597
00:42:18,080 --> 00:42:19,200
is more important.
